("ms.temple.films/index.html.n73", "description", "{\"kind\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A trailer rendered entirely from code: a sky computed pixel by pixel, lights that leave trails, the commandments set in type, and a drone synthesised from sine waves and noise. No cameras, no stock footage, no generated video — every frame can be rendered again from the site’s own source.\"}")
