("ms.temple.films/index.html.n154", "description", "{\"kind\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The film is a separate pipeline beside the site. A choreography file sets every scene, plate, light, spark and chime to the tenth of a second; one Python script turns it into picture and sound with ffmpeg and headless Chrome.\"}")
